                        


Item #:  SCP-5156

Object Class:  Euclid, Potential Keter.

Special Containment Procedures:  SCP-5156 is to be kept at a 16x16 white room exactly 3 feet above the ground and 4 bulletproof glasses, 1 for each corner (This helps said SCP stay sane by seeing employees through glass). With a gas pipe filled with nerve gas for control usage.

Description:  SCP-5156 is a mutated virus that came from an unknown planet. It's appearance is a genderless Humanoid-shaped figure that has arms twirling uncontrollably every second for an odd reason. SCP-5156's capabilities are yet to be understood, but the one discovered is regeneration. SCP-5156's regeneration from wounds and such is absurd, it has come to a point where SCP-5156 can regenerate a limb for approximately 3 seconds. Sightings of SCP-5156 have been spotted in ██████. Thankfully, only a handful of people saw it. Further research of SCP-5156 is ordered by the 05 Council. Reports and Investigation will be available to those of Level 4+ Clearance.

